Aim: To generate a chronological timeline of system events using file system meladata through Plasto or Autospy and to identify anemaleus user or system behaviour through timeline analysis techniques

Theary

Timeline Analysis: Temporal reconstruction of system activities using timestamps to correlated events and establish sequence of actions on a system

